<title>JAPAN: Sagami Chain plans share split.</title>
<headline>Sagami Chain plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sagami Chain Co Ltd said on</p>
<p>Monday it planned a 1.05-for-1 share split on March</p>
<p>13, for shareholders as of January 20.</p>
</text>
